WEBVTT

00:00:00.738 --> 00:00:02.917
<v><b>Salesman:</b></v> Is the car for you, sir?

00:00:06.855 --> 00:00:08.727
<v><b>Woman:</b></v> No, it’s for me.

00:00:12.429 --> 00:00:14.679
<v><b>Man:</b></v> Yes, it’s for my mother.

00:00:18.960 --> 00:00:22.693
<v><b>Salesman:</b></v> Well madam, what about this blue car here?

00:00:27.875 --> 00:00:30.687
It’s small and it’s easy to park.

00:00:35.031 --> 00:00:37.986
<v><b>Man:</b></v> Yes, Mum, it’s perfect for you.

00:00:42.477 --> 00:00:44.563
<v><b>Woman:</b></v> But it’s very slow.

00:00:48.292 --> 00:00:49.116
And it’s ugly.

00:00:51.674 --> 00:00:53.792
<v><b>Salesman:</b></v> It’s an electric car, madam.

00:00:57.256 --> 00:00:59.107
Very eco-friendly.

00:01:02.314 --> 00:01:03.754
They’re good cars.

00:01:06.718 --> 00:01:09.942
<v><b>Woman:</b></v> I prefer…that red car.

00:01:14.716 --> 00:01:18.024
<v><b>Man:</b></v> But Mum, it’s a sports car!

00:01:22.966 --> 00:01:24.533
It’s very fast.

00:01:27.709 --> 00:01:29.848
And it’s very expensive.

00:01:33.615 --> 00:01:36.265
<v><b>Woman:</b></v> Yes, but it’s my money.

00:01:40.478 --> 00:01:43.493
It’s a beautiful car and I love it!

00:01:48.176 --> 00:01:49.222
How much is it?

00:01:51.805 --> 00:01:53.529
<v><b>Salesman:</b></v> Come with me, madam.

00:01:56.882 --> 00:01:57.746
<v><b>Man:</b></v> Mum! …